karya kaligrafi palsu.

16:08.750 --> 16:09.410
Abang Rong.

16:13.150 --> 16:13.670
Jalan.

16:15.960 --> 16:16.620
Abang Rong!

16:16.790 --> 16:18.150
Abang Rong, saya belum naik kereta lagi!

16:18.150 --> 16:18.820
Abang Rong!

16:19.000 --> 16:19.480
Saya...

16:19.840 --> 16:20.500
Abang Rong!

16:22.120 --> 16:23.720
Bonet belakang belum tutup.

16:28.440 --> 16:30.430
Ye berumur 39 tahun,

16:30.480 --> 16:31.000
