29:16.160 --> 29:17.160
Helo, tuan polis.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.550
Helo, tuan polis.

29:19.270 --> 29:20.270
Helo, tuan polis.

29:21.270 --> 29:22.270
Helo, Abang Wang.

29:24.830 --> 29:26.270
Awak kena jaga pertuturan awak.

29:26.270 --> 29:27.400
Helo, Pegawai Wang.

29:28.510 --> 29:30.110
Ini Timbalan Ketua Biro Zhang.

29:30.110 --> 29:30.750
Helo.

29:30.920 --> 29:31.590
Kami datang hari ini

29:31.590 --> 29:32.350
